Package: ShuttleboxR
Title: Data Preparation and Exploration for Shuttle-Box Temperature Experiments
Version: 0.0.0.9016
Authors@R: 
    person("Pieter", "Riesenkamp", , "p.b.riesenkamp@student.rug.nl", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a structured workflow for importing and organising
    ShuttleSoft temperature shuttle-box data, calculating reproducible thermal
    and behavioural metrics, including distance-based and percentile-based measures of selected
    thermal breadth, gravitation-aware analysis windows, and inspection of
    single trials and complete projects before statistical analysis. Project-level tools help 
    flag unusual trials for closer inspection.
